          "(1) text: replace \"an investigation opened and never concluded\" with \"no SC order or DRI adjudication located to Sep 2026\". (2) text/d: add \"SC stayed the Bombay HC order in Jan 2020 (ThePrint, Oct 2023); DRI in Oct 2023 again asked the SC to allow Singapore evidence collection\". (3) d: name Adani Enterprises Ltd as the Bombay HC petitioner and Adani Global Pte as the holder of the records sought. (4) d: note the probe was industry-wide (40 importers, 5 Adani companies). (5) Add a contra edge from grp:adani to claim:enforce:c017 carrying the Oct 2023 \"conclusively settled by India's highest court\" statement (ThePrint URL), with the note that the Jan 2023 withdrawal related to a different matter. (6) Add corroborating sources: Business Today/Reuters 17 Nov 2023 (https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/corporate/story/dri-seeks-permission-to-restart-probe-into-adani-group-over-overvaluation-of-coal-imports-report-406047-2023-11-17) and The Hindu 13 Mar 2023 parliamentary reply that the DRI probe was not concluded. (7) Mark \"6 Aug 2024\" as year inferred from the article date, since the source says only \"August 6\". (8) \"from\": the 2016 date is right for the circular; keep it but label it approximate."
