        "innocentReading": "He says the lease-approval file was altered: the beneficiary's name was added by hand above his signature, and it is not his handwriting. On this reading, bureaucrats inserted the choice of lessee, and the CM signed a routine note-sheet during the 2001-08 rush of lease grants that the report itself blames on \"pressures and political compulsions\" across governments. The report also did not recommend action against him, because he held no public post in 2011. It only said the government was free to act on his \"misconduct\". No court has yet made a finding against him. The Governor's prosecution sanction was sought in Nov 2023 and again in Aug 2024, and was still pending as of Feb 2025 per search results.",
