          "text: replace \"by 4–6 weeks after the trust had declared nil receipts FY21–FY24\" with \"by 33 days (2024-04-02); the trust had made no donations FY2021-22 to FY2023-24 (Scroll)\".\ntext/innocentReading: delete \"trusts were the only lawful corporate channel left\" (direct s.182 donations were still lawful). Replace it with: \"PET donates only in Lok Sabha election years (FY2018-19: Rs 454 cr, ~75% to BJP; dormant 2014–17 and FY22–24); BJP's 83% share of PET matches its ~82% share of all trust money in FY25; PET also gave INC Rs 77.3 cr and eight parties Rs 10 cr each; the same 29 Feb 2024 Cabinet decision approved the non-Tata CG Power/Murugappa unit.\"\nAlso delete \"every large group switched to trusts\" from the record's innocentReading. It is an overstatement with no source.\nto: 2024-04-30 → 2024-04-02.\nd: \"₹758 cr\" → \"₹757.62 cr\"; \"dormant 2021–24\" → \"no donations FY2021-22 to FY2023-24\".\nkillIf: add \"or PET's donations are shown to follow a fixed election-year cycle with a pre-set party formula\".\nc043: add the Al Jazeera 18 Feb 2026 non-response (Tata asked, no reply).\nNode fact at line ~1941 (\"nil receipts FY2020-21 to FY2023-24 [documented]\"): change it to nil donations FY22–FY24, and note that the FY2019-20 filings are missing.\nCheck separately the \"Rs 834.97 cr in two donations per BJP's report\" figure on the progressive→bjp edge."
