        "denialFound": "None found. Westinghouse was not asked in any source. Its newsroom (info.westinghousenuclear.com/news) has no release on India, SHANTI, Kovvada or liability. The WNN article on the Act says nothing on supplier recourse or vendor reaction. The web-search budget was used up, so a wider search for a response could not be run. The platform has no record that it asked Westinghouse for comment.",
