        "innocentReading": "Electoral bonds were a legal donation channel from 2018 until the Supreme Court struck them down in Feb 2024. A large infrastructure contractor working in many states donates to whichever parties govern those states: BJP at the Centre and in many states, BRS in Telangana, DMK in Tamil Nadu, YSRCP/TDP in Andhra Pradesh. That pattern alone explains the split, and the split roughly tracks each party's share of power.",
