        "denialFound": "Yes, and the record wrongly treats it as missing. States:c024 says the denial text could not be found. Indian Express/PTI (12 Aug 2026) reports: \"The Adani Group has consistently denied the allegations, saying it acted in accordance with the applicable law.\" Gautam Adani said \"truth has prevailed\" and that \"our faith in truth, fairness and the rule of law remained unwavering\" (post on X after the 10 Aug 2026 dismissal). Adani's lawyers also said the $10bn US investment pledge \"was never offered in exchange for dropping the charges\". MLex (1 Jun 2026) reports that amended SEC settlement documents allow Adani to deny the SEC's allegations. Source: https://indianexpress.com/article/india/relief-to-adani-us-court-permanently-dismisses-criminal-case-against-him-10828913/",
